{
  "name": "Dispelling Recovery",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Immediately after you cast a spell with a spell slot that restores hit points to a creature or ends a condition on a creature, you can cast Dispel Magic as part of that Action, Bonus Action, or Reaction, and without expending a spell slot.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Short Rest or Long Rest. You also restore your use of it by expending one use of Channel Divinity (no action required).</p>",
